OL,5,G2305 999: Critical Condition
OL,6,     FCara has fallen 50 metres down a
OL,7,     Fwaterfall. She has multiple
OL,8,     Fobvious injuries that need urgent
OL,9,     Fcare, but Dr Richard Fawcett must
OL,10,     Falso investigate hidden internal
OL,11,     Finjuries.
OL,12,G0005 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,14,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,15,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,16,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,17,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,18,     Fsufferers.
